    "html": "<section class=\"lens-view lens-dispatch-view\"><h3>line-density-count · 3×1×1 workgroups × 256×1×1 lanes = 768 invocations</h3><svg class=\"lens-workgroups\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 24\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Workgroups\"><defs><pattern id=\"lens-gpu-spatial-analysis-line-density-kernel-hatched\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#595959\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line></pattern></defs><rect x=\"1\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#181818\" stroke-width=\"3\" data-state=\"selection\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"0\"></rect><rect x=\"21\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"41\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"2\"></rect></svg><h4>Workgroup 0 (default)</h4><svg class=\"lens-lanes\" viewBox=\"0 0 1280 256\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Lanes in expanded workgroup\"><defs><pattern id=\"lens-gpu-spatial-analysis-line-density-kernel-lanes-hatched\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#595959\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line></pattern></defs><image width=\"1280\" height=\"256\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" image-rendering=\"pixelated\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" data-raster-width=\"32\" data-raster-height=\"8\" data-sampling=\"nearest\" href=\"data:image/png;base64,\"></image><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"0\"><text x=\"5\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">0</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"1\"><text x=\"45\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">1</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"2\"><text x=\"85\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">2</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"3\"><text x=\"125\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">3</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"4\"><text x=\"165\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">4</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"5\"><text x=\"205\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">5</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"6\"><text x=\"245\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">6</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"7\"><text x=\"285\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">7</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"8\"><text x=\"325\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">8</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"9\"><text x=\"365\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">9</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"10\"><text x=\"405\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">10</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"11\"><text x=\"445\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">11</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"12\"><text x=\"485\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">12</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"13\"><text x=\"525\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">13</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"14\"><text x=\"565\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">14</text></g></svg><p>256 lanes; first 15 and pinned lane labelled. Grey cells are idle or unavailable.</p><p>id probe not recorded; lane ids are computed from the dispatch shape · apple</p><figure class=\"lens-kernel-source\"><pre><code data-language=\"wgsl\"><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"1\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"2\">override INVOCATION_COUNT: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"3\">override WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_X: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"4\">override WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_Y: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"5\">const positionsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"6\">@group(0) @binding(0) var&lt;storage, read&gt; positions: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"7\">const lineOffsetsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"8\">@group(0) @binding(1) var&lt;storage, read&gt; lineOffsets: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"9\">const parametersOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"10\">@group(0) @binding(2) var&lt;storage, read&gt; parameters: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"11\">const countsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"12\">@group(0) @binding(3) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; counts: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"13\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"14\">const LINE_COUNT: u32 = 223u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"15\">const ROW_COUNT: u32 = 513u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"16\">const COLUMNS: i32 = 15;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"17\">const ROWS: i32 = 13;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"18\">const CAPACITY: u32 = 2052u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"19\">const RADIUS: f32 = 1.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"20\">const INFINITE: f32 = 3.0e38;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"21\">const EMITS_PIECES: bool = false;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"22\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"23\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"24\">const NO_LINE: u32 = 0xffffffffu;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"25\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"26\">fn findLine(row: u32) -&gt; u32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"27\">  var low = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"28\">  var high = LINE_COUNT + 1u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"29\">  while (low &lt; high) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"30\">    let middle = (low + high) / 2u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"31\">    if (lineOffsets[lineOffsetsOffset + middle] &lt;= row) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"32\">      low = middle + 1u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"33\">    } else {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"34\">      high = middle;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"35\">    }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"36\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"37\">  if (low == 0u || low &gt; LINE_COUNT) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"38\">    return NO_LINE;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"39\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"40\">  return low - 1u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"41\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"42\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"43\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"44\">fn getPosition(row: u32) -&gt; vec2&lt;f32&gt; {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"45\">  return vec2&lt;f32&gt;(positions[positionsOffset + 2u * row], positions[positionsOffset + 2u * row + 1u]);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"46\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"47\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"48\">fn getPieceLength(a: vec2&lt;f32&gt;, b: vec2&lt;f32&gt;, t0: f32, t1: f32) -&gt; f32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"49\">  return (t1 - t0) * length(b - a);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"50\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"51\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"52\">fn walkSegment(row: u32, slot: u32) -&gt; u32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"53\">  let line = findLine(row);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"54\">  if (line == NO_LINE) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"55\">    return 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"56\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"57\">  if (row + 1u &gt;= min(lineOffsets[lineOffsetsOffset + line + 1u], ROW_COUNT)) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"58\">    return 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"59\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"60\">  let origin = vec2&lt;f32&gt;(parameters[parametersOffset], parameters[parametersOffset + 1u]);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"61\">  let cellSize = vec2&lt;f32&gt;(parameters[parametersOffset + 2u], parameters[parametersOffset + 3u]);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"62\">  let a = getPosition(row);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"63\">  let b = getPosition(row + 1u);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"64\">  let ua = (a - origin) / cellSize;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"65\">  let delta = (b - origin) / cellSize - ua;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"66\">  // Liang-Barsky against [0, COLUMNS] x [0, ROWS].\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"67\">  var t0 = 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"68\">  var t1 = 1.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"69\">  var p = array&lt;f32, 4&gt;(-delta.x, delta.x, -delta.y, delta.y);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"70\">  var q = array&lt;f32, 4&gt;(ua.x, f32(COLUMNS) - ua.x, ua.y, f32(ROWS) - ua.y);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"71\">  for (var side = 0u; side &lt; 4u; side++) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"72\">    if (p[side] == 0.0) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"73\">      if (q[side] &lt; 0.0) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"74\">        return 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"75\">      }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"76\">    } else {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"77\">      let r = q[side] / p[side];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"78\">      if (p[side] &lt; 0.0) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"79\">        if (r &gt; t1) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"80\">          return 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"81\">        }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"82\">        t0 = max(t0, r);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"83\">      } else {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"84\">        if (r &lt; t0) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"85\">          return 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"86\">        }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"87\">        t1 = min(t1, r);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"88\">      }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"89\">    }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"90\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"91\">  if (t1 &lt;= t0) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"92\">    return 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"93\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"94\">  let start = ua + delta * t0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"95\">  let end = ua + delta * t1;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"96\">  var cx = clamp(i32(floor(start.x)), 0, COLUMNS - 1);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"97\">  var cy = clamp(i32(floor(start.y)), 0, ROWS - 1);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"98\">  let endX = clamp(i32(floor(end.x)), 0, COLUMNS - 1);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"99\">  let endY = clamp(i32(floor(end.y)), 0, ROWS - 1);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"100\">  var stepsX = u32(abs(endX - cx));\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"101\">  var stepsY = u32(abs(endY - cy));\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"102\">  let pieceCount = stepsX + stepsY + 1u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"103\">  // The counting pass only needs the piece count; walking the cells would be wasted work.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"104\">  if (!EMITS_PIECES) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"105\">    return pieceCount;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"106\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"107\">  let stepX = select(-1, 1, delta.x &gt; 0.0);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"108\">  let stepY = select(-1, 1, delta.y &gt; 0.0);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"109\">  var tMaxX = INFINITE;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"110\">  var tMaxY = INFINITE;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"111\">  if (stepsX &gt; 0u) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"112\">    tMaxX = t0 + (select(f32(cx), f32(cx + 1), delta.x &gt; 0.0) - start.x) / delta.x;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"113\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"114\">  if (stepsY &gt; 0u) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"115\">    tMaxY = t0 + (select(f32(cy), f32(cy + 1), delta.y &gt; 0.0) - start.y) / delta.y;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"116\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"117\">  let tDeltaX = select(INFINITE, 1.0 / abs(delta.x), delta.x != 0.0);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"118\">  let tDeltaY = select(INFINITE, 1.0 / abs(delta.y), delta.y != 0.0);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"119\">  var tCurrent = t0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"120\">  for (var piece = 0u; piece &lt; pieceCount; piece++) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"121\">    let moveX = stepsX &gt; 0u &amp;&amp; (stepsY == 0u || tMaxX &lt;= tMaxY);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"122\">    var tNext = t1;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"123\">    if (piece + 1u &lt; pieceCount) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"124\">      tNext = clamp(select(tMaxY, tMaxX, moveX), tCurrent, t1);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"125\">    }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"126\">    \n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"127\">    if (moveX) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"128\">      cx += stepX;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"129\">      stepsX -= 1u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"130\">      tMaxX += tDeltaX;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"131\">    } else {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"132\">      cy += stepY;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"133\">      stepsY -= 1u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"134\">      tMaxY += tDeltaY;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"135\">    }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"136\">    tCurrent = tNext;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"137\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"138\">  return pieceCount;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"139\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"140\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"141\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--workgroup-size\" data-line=\"142\">@compute @workgroup_size(256)\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--entry-point\" data-line=\"143\">fn main(\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"144\">  @builtin(local_invocation_index) localInvocationIndex: u32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"145\">  @builtin(workgroup_id) workgroupId: vec3&lt;u32&gt;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"146\">) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"147\">  _ = &amp;positions;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"148\">  _ = &amp;lineOffsets;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"149\">  _ = &amp;parameters;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"150\">  _ = &amp;counts;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"151\">  _ = INVOCATION_COUNT;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"152\">  let workgroupIndex =\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"153\">    (workgroupId.z * WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_Y + workgroupId.y) * WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_X +\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"154\">    workgroupId.x;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"155\">  if (workgroupIndex &gt;= 16777216u) { return; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"156\">  let index = workgroupIndex * 256u + localInvocationIndex;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"157\">  if (index &gt;= INVOCATION_COUNT) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"158\">    return;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"159\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"160\">  counts[countsOffset + index] = walkSegment(index, 0u);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"161\">}\n</span></code></pre><table><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Resource</th><th>Access</th><th>Element type</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>positions<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"positions\">positions</td><td>read</td><td>f32</td></tr><tr><td>lineOffsets<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"lineOffsets\">lineOffsets</td><td>read</td><td>u32</td></tr><tr><td>parameters<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"parameters\">parameters</td><td>read</td><td>f32</td></tr><tr><td>counts<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"line-density-counts\">line-density-counts</td><td>read_write</td><td>u32</td></tr></tbody></table><figcaption>GPULineDensity/count · main · 56d5aa59</figcaption></figure></section>",
